## Systems the access tools cannot reach

Logs and dashboards that live on a separate instance (another team's, or a network layer in front of the services) never appear in the queries above, and absence there is not evidence a request was never made. Mark facts you cannot verify here with `(external: <team>)` or `(human: <{{ git.user_label }}>, <date>)`.

- <system>: <what it is> — <entry point>; <who knows>.
{{/if}}
